---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { siteConfig } from '../config'
---

<BaseLayout title="Accessibility statement" description="Accessibility target, current testing status, known limitations, and barrier-reporting contact for the Regulatory Readiness website.">
  <header class="legal-header"><div class="narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Accessibility statement</p><h1>Access is a release requirement.</h1><p class="lead">We want this public website to work for the widest practical range of people, devices, and assistive technologies.</p></div></header>
  <article class="legal-doc"><div class="narrow prose"><p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 31 August 2026</p><h2>Standard targeted</h2><p>This site targets the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at Level AA. The implementation includes semantic landmarks, a skip link, visible keyboard focus, responsive layouts, reduced-motion support, and content that remains readable without client-side JavaScript.</p><h2>Current testing status</h2><p>Automated checks are part of the build for key routes. A manual keyboard and screen-reader acceptance pass is still required before public launch; until that is recorded, we do not claim that every part of the site meets the target.</p><h2>Known limitations</h2><ul><li>Legal identity and policy content remains visibly marked for owner or counsel review.</li><li>Sign-up and the operator app are a separate application with their own accessibility statement; this statement covers the public marketing site only.</li><li>Production analytics and hosting configuration are not active in this repository build.</li></ul><h2>Report a barrier</h2><p>Email <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}?subject=Accessibility%20barrier`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a> with the page address, what you were trying to do, and the browser or assistive technology you used if you are comfortable sharing it.</p><p>We will acknowledge reports within two business days and provide a substantive update within ten business days. If a fix needs longer, we will explain the plan and offer an accessible alternative where possible.</p></div></article>
</BaseLayout>
